{"lang":"zh-CN","summary":"Navigation: 工具调用与MCP MOC","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Agent 工具选择的实现方式\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"工具调用与MCP\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> intermediate\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> medium\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/工具调用\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/intermediate</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/04-%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP/%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP%20MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/04-%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP/%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP%20MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">工具调用与MCP MOC</a></p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Agent 如何准确选择应该调用哪个工具？有哪些工具选择的实现策略？</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"答案\" dir=\"auto\">答案</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">工具选择（Tool Selection）是 Agent 系统的核心能力之一。当工具数量较多时，让 LLM 直接从所有工具中选择效率低且容易出错，需要更智能的选择策略。</p>\n<h3 data-heading=\"工具选择的三种策略\" dir=\"auto\">工具选择的三种策略</h3>\n<h4 data-heading=\"策略一：LLM 直接选择（小工具集）\" dir=\"auto\">策略一：LLM 直接选择（小工具集）</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">当工具数量 ≤ 8 个时，直接将所有工具的 Schema 传给 LLM，让模型自行选择。</p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token comment\"># 直接选择：所有工具一次性传给 LLM</span>\nresponse <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> client<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>chat<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>completions<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>create<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    model<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"gpt-4o\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    messages<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"role\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"user\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"content\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> user_query<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    tools<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>all_tool_schemas<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 8个以内的工具</span>\n    tool_choice<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"auto\"</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>优点</strong>：简单直接，无需额外组件<br>\n<strong>缺点</strong>：工具多了上下文爆炸，选择准确率下降</p>\n<h4 data-heading=\"策略二：检索式工具选择（大工具集）\" dir=\"auto\">策略二：检索式工具选择（大工具集）</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">工具数量很多时，先用检索器筛选出最相关的 K 个工具，再交给 LLM 选择。</p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> sklearn<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>feature_extraction<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>text <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> TfidfVectorizer\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> sklearn<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>metrics<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>pairwise <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> cosine_similarity\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">ToolRetriever</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"基于 TF-IDF 的工具检索器\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tools <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> tools\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>vectorizer <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> TfidfVectorizer<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 用工具名称+描述构建语料</span>\n        corpus <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>t<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">'function'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">'name'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\"> </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>t<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">'function'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">'description'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span> \n                  <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> t <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>vectors <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>vectorizer<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>fit_transform<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>corpus<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">retrieve</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> query<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> top_k<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">int</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">3</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"检索与查询最相关的 K 个工具\"\"\"</span>\n        query_vec <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>vectorizer<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>transform<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        similarities <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> cosine_similarity<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>query_vec<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>vectors<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 获取 top-k 索引</span>\n        top_indices <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> similarities<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>argsort<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token operator\">-</span>top_k<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>i<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> top_indices<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 使用示例</span>\nretriever <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> ToolRetriever<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>all_tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nrelevant_tools <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> retriever<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>retrieve<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"北京今天天气怎么样？\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> top_k<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">3</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\"># relevant_tools 可能包含 [get_weather, web_search, query_location]</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>优点</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">大幅降低上下文长度</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">工具数量扩展到数百个仍可保持高效</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">检索准确率高（TF-IDF/BM25/向量检索）</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>改进方案：多级检索</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">HierarchicalToolSelector</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"分层工具选择器\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tools <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> tools\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 按领域分类</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>categories <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"数据查询\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>t <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> t <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> tools <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"query\"</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> t<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"function\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"name\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"文件操作\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>t <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> t <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> tools <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"file\"</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> t<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"function\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"name\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"外部API\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>t <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> t <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> tools <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"api\"</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> t<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"function\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"name\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">select</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> query<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> llm_client<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 第一层：选择类别</span>\n        category_prompt <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"\"\"\n        根据用户问题，选择最相关的工具类别：\n        用户问题：</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\n        可用类别：</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token builtin\">list</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>categories<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>keys<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\n        只返回类别名称，不要解释。\n        \"\"\"</span></span>\n        category <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> llm_client<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>complete<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>category_prompt<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 第二层：在类别内选择具体工具</span>\n        candidate_tools <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>categories<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>category<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>strip<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> candidate_tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token number\">5</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 返回前5个候选</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h4 data-heading=\"策略三：Embedding 向量检索（语义匹配）\" dir=\"auto\">策略三：Embedding 向量检索（语义匹配）</h4>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> sentence_transformers <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> SentenceTransformer\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">SemanticToolRetriever</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"基于语义向量的工具检索器\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>model <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> SentenceTransformer<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'BAAI/bge-large-zh-v1.5'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tools <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> tools\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 编码工具描述</span>\n        descriptions <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>t<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"function\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"description\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> t <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tool_embeddings <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>model<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>encode<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>descriptions<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">retrieve</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> query<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> top_k<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">int</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">3</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        query_embedding <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>model<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>encode<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        similarities <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> cosine_similarity<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>query_embedding<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tool_embeddings<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        top_indices <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> similarities<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>argsort<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token operator\">-</span>top_k<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>i<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> top_indices<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h3 data-heading=\"工具选择优化技巧\" dir=\"auto\">工具选择优化技巧</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技巧</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>工具描述优化</strong></td>\n<td>描述中明确适用场景和不适用场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Few-shot 示例</strong></td>\n<td>提供工具选择的示例对话</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>工具分类标签</strong></td>\n<td>给工具打标签，便于快速筛选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>动态工具集</strong></td>\n<td>按会话上下文动态调整可用工具</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>调用必要性判断</strong></td>\n<td>显式加入\"不调用工具\"的选项</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3 data-heading=\"调用必要性判断（防止无意义调用）\" dir=\"auto\">调用必要性判断（防止无意义调用）</h3>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token comment\"># 在工具列表中加入\"不调用\"选项</span>\nno_tool_option <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"type\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"function\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"function\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"name\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"no_tool_needed\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"description\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"当用户问题不需要工具就能回答时使用，如闲聊、确认、总结等场景\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"parameters\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"type\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"object\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"properties\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\nall_tools_with_option <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> all_tools <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>no_tool_option<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h2 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Q: 工具选择准确率怎么评估？</strong><br>\nA: 核心指标包括：工具选择准确率、参数有效率、无工具场景误调用率、该调用未调用率。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Q: 工具数量超过 100 个怎么办？</strong><br>\nA: 采用多级检索体系——先用 BM25 粗筛到 Top-20，再用语义向量精筛到 Top-5，最后让 LLM 决策。</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">常见误区</h2>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>误区</strong>：工具越多越好。<br>\n<strong>纠正</strong>：工具过多会增加选择难度，应合并相似工具，保持工具集精简。</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>误区</strong>：只用 LLM 选择就够了。<br>\n<strong>纠正</strong>：大工具集必须使用检索式预选，否则上下文过长、准确率下降。</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>误区</strong>：所有场景都给同样的工具集。<br>\n<strong>纠正</strong>：应按场景动态调整，如客服场景只给客服相关工具。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>","headings":[]}